          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147950,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o número máximo de valores que um array pode conter em um jogo (como inimigos em um nível)?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quantos quisermos</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">10</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quantos quisermos.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147951,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que é um elemento?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Um valor em um array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Um array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A condição de um array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Um valor em um array.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147952,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atribua um array com o valor <code>\"Collect 10 coins\"</code> à variável <code>questLog</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Defeat the dragon&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" questLog = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Collect 10 coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Quest Log:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(questLog);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>[</code> seguido de <code>\"Collect 10 coins\"</code> e finalmente <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147953,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie um array armazenando <code>\"forest\"</code> e <code>\"dungeon\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levels = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dungeon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levels);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>[</code> seguido de <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147954,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ \"\" ]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ inventory ]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147955,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o índice de <code>\"slime\"</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147956,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atualize o segundo elemento para <code>\"Mage\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"party[2]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Paladin&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"53\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" party = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Rogue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"party[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(party);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>party[1]</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>\"Mage\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147957,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o último índice que podemos acessar neste array?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" checkpointsReached = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147958,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Código <code>\"Meg\"</code> no índice <code>0</code> e <code>\"Max\"</code> no índice <code>1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"Meg\"</code> seguido de <code>\"Max\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147959,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como acessamos o valor <code>22</code> neste array?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreMilestones = [\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>scoreMilestones[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>scoreMilestones[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>scoreMilestones(2)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>scoreMilestones[2]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147960,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que <code>.pop()</code> faz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Remove o último valor de um array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Remove o primeiro valor de um array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Remove um valor aleatório de um array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Remove o último valor de um array.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147961,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que <code>.push()</code> faz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Adiciona um valor a um array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Remove um valor de um array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ele cria um array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Adiciona um valor a um array.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 147962,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione <code>\"Health Potion\"</code> a este array de inventário.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Mana Potion&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"76\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wooden Sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"inventory.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>inventory</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e depois <code>push</code>, <code>\"Health Potion\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 147963,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o índice de <code>\"Fire Rune\"</code> no array, após adicioná-lo com <code>push()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" runes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ice Rune&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"runes.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Fire Rune&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(runes);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 147964,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o valor de <code>lastLife</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" extraLives = [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lastLife = extraLives.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lastLife);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
