            "id": 147966,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este trecho de código vai exibir no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bosses = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime King&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin Chief&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Stone Golem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shadow Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"bosses.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"bosses.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bosses.length);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"6\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
