            "id": 147967,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este trecho de código vai exibir no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lootBag = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lootBag.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lootBag.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;map&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lootBag);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"coin\", \"gem\", \"key\", \"potion\", \"map\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"coin\", \"gem\", \"key\", \"potion\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">5</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[\"coin\", \"gem\", \"key\", \"potion\", \"map\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
